      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "## LC Skin Upscale\n\n\n---\n### Follow me on CivitAi [HERE](https://civitai.com/user/lonecatone23)\n\n### Instagram: [synth.studio.models](https://www.instagram.com/synth.studio.models/)\n\n### This represents many of hours of work. If you enjoy it, please 👍like, 💬 comment , and feel free to ⚡tip 😉\n\n## [Buy me a☕](https://ko-fi.com/lonecatone)\n---\n\n**Daily settings**\n- Model: `1xSkinContrast-High-SuperUltraCompact`\n- mode: `detail 1x`\n- blend: `0.75` (drop to `0.55–0.65` on already-sharp Krea plates)\n- mask: PersonMaskUltra `face` + `body`\n- mask_source: `input`\n- mask_feather: `0.45`\n- tile: `256` · overlap: `16`\n- Do not load a 4× model in this node\n\n**Widgets**\n- **mode `detail 1x`** — run the model, paste back at the original size. Use this for every 1× skin file.\n- **mode `scale`** — keep the model’s native factor (4× Nomos = 4× canvas). Only when you actually want more pixels.\n- **blend 0–1** — 0 = original, 1 = full patch under the mask, 0.75 = default mix.\n- **mask_source `input`** — use the wired Ultra mask only.\n- **mask_source `chroma`** — auto skin, no Ultra.\n- **mask_source `input+chroma`** — AND. Skip unless clothes leak into Ultra.\n- **mask_feather** — soft edge on the composite.\n- **tile / overlap** — CNN chunks. 256/16 on large plates; 512 is slower for little gain.\n\n**Mask**\n- Skin Get/Set = Ultra `face` + `body`\n- Face only if you do not want the chest treated\n- Not RMBG, not a 4× model, not stacked passes\n\n---\n\n## 1× skin CNN models\n\nFolder: `ComfyUI/models/upscale_models`\n\n| Model | Use | Visible | Link |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| **1x-ITF-SkinDiffDetail-Lite-v1** | Quiet grit after a real 2×/4× | Weak on purpose | https://openmodeldb.info/models/1x-ITF-SkinDiffDetail-Lite-v1 |\n| **1xSkinContrast-High-SuperUltraCompact** | Local contrast on skin (this node) | Visible on Krea at blend 0.75 | https://openmodeldb.info/models/1x-SkinContrast-SuperUltraCompact · High: https://www.mediafire.com/file/py46fnq12hhs5sz/1xSkinContrast-High-SuperUltraCompact.pth/file · HF: https://huggingface.co/notkenski/upscalers/blob/main/1xSkinContrast-High-SuperUltraCompact.pth |\n| **1x PureVision** | Cleanup before a 4× | Not a beauty pass | https://github.com/daredevilstudio/AI-upscaling-models |\n\n---\n\n---\n\n\n## LC 皮肤放大（Skin Upscale）\n\n---\n### 在 CivitAi 上关注我 [HERE](https://civitai.com/user/lonecatone23)\n### Instagram: [synth.studio.models](https://www.instagram.com/synth.studio.models/)\n### 这代表数百小时的工作成果。如果你喜欢，请 👍点赞、💬留言，并欢迎随时 ⚡打赏 😉\n\n## [Buy me a☕](https://ko-fi.com/lonecatone)\n\n---\n\n**日常设置**\n- 模型：`1xSkinContrast-High-SuperUltraCompact`\n- mode：`detail 1x`\n- blend：`0.75`（Krea 成品已经很锐时降到 `0.55–0.65`）\n- 遮罩：PersonMaskUltra 勾选 `face` + `body`\n- mask_source：`input`\n- mask_feather：`0.45`\n- tile：`256` · overlap：`16`\n- 不要在这个节点里加载 4× 模型\n\n**控件说明**\n- **mode `detail 1x`**：跑模型后贴回原尺寸。所有 1× 皮肤模型都用这个。\n- **mode `scale`**：保留模型原生倍率（Nomos 4× = 画布真的变 4 倍）。只有真要加像素时才用。\n- **blend 0–1**：0 = 原图，1 = 遮罩内完全替换，0.75 = 默认混合。\n- **mask_source `input`**：只用接进来的 Ultra 遮罩。\n- **mask_source `chroma`**：自动肤色，不用 Ultra。\n- **mask_source `input+chroma`**：两者求交。Ultra 没漏衣服就不要开。\n- **mask_feather**：合成边缘的羽化。\n- **tile / overlap**：CNN 分块。大图用 256/16；512 更慢，收益很小。\n\n**遮罩**\n- 皮肤 Get/Set = Ultra `face` + `body`\n- 只要脸、不要胸，就只勾 `face`\n- 不要用 RMBG、不要用 4×、不要叠第二遍\n\n---\n\n## 1× 皮肤 CNN 模型\n\n目录：`ComfyUI/models/upscale_models`\n\n| 模型 | 用途 | 观感 | 链接 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| **1x-ITF-SkinDiffDetail-Lite-v1** | 真正 2×/4× 之后的轻度纹理 | 刻意很弱 | https://openmodeldb.info/models/1x-ITF-SkinDiffDetail-Lite-v1 |\n| **1xSkinContrast-High-SuperUltraCompact** | 皮肤局部对比度（本节点） | Krea 上 blend 0.75 能看出 | https://openmodeldb.info/models/1x-SkinContrast-SuperUltraCompact · High：https://www.mediafire.com/file/py46fnq12hhs5sz/1xSkinContrast-High-SuperUltraCompact.pth/file · HF：https://huggingface.co/notkenski/upscalers/blob/main/1xSkinContrast-High-SuperUltraCompact.pth |\n| **1x PureVision** | 4× 之前的压缩清理 | 不是美肤 | https://github.com/daredevilstudio/AI-upscaling-models |"
      ],
      "widgets_values_named": {
